  "discription": {
    "note": "Fast-growing native shrub with corky bark, flat creamy-white fragrant flower heads in June and black berries loved by birds. Flowers edible raw; berries only edible cooked, leaves and bark toxic. Indicator of nitrogen-rich soil.",
